 "words_heard": 167,
 "words": 167,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "They rounded up the scoundrels",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 1.44,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "From the marketplace street",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 1.4,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Formed a wild and angry mob",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 1.46,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "In the city's heat",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 1.53,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "They stormed the house at night",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 1.41,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "To find the two men",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 1.35,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "But they could not find them there",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 1.24,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "So the search was done",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 1.2,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "They dragged Jason to the court",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.62,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Along with some brothers",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 0.79,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Shouting out their accusation",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 0.94,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "With their loud reports",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 1.08,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "These men turned the world upside down",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.16,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Now they have come here",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.42,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Jason has taken them in",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.85,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The anger is clear",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 0.73,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "They act against the decrees",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.79,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Of Caesar the great",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 0.39,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Saying there is another king",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.52,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "With a different fate",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 0.6,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The crowd was thrown into confusion",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.51,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The officials confused",
   "heard": 3,
   "words": 3,
   "error_s": 0.37,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But Jason stood his ground",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.4,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "In this dangerous news",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 0.2,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "So they took bail from Jason",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.26,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And the others too",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 0.05,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And released them from the court",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.14,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "As the day broke through",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.23,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The cost was paid for the gospel",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.08,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The loss was his share",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.13,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Yet he welcomed them freely",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.13,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "With his open door",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 0.16,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Jason sends his greetings",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 0.33,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "A kinsman of Paul",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 0.33,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  }
